      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to official GET /users?page[size]=1 on the documented default US host, matching the pinned validator path.",
        "EU (api.eu.itglue.com) and AU (api.au.itglue.com) hosts are computed from a stored region enum whose US value is api.itglue.com, not api.us.itglue.com, so a bounded wildcard plus required stored id cannot represent the mapping. The native template pins api.itglue.com.",
        "Native category is productivity rather than security: IT Glue is IT documentation, but Rust CATEGORIES has no security bucket; admitted ops are user and organization reads.",
        "The pinned source sends Content-Type: application/vnd.api+json on GET; official docs say Content-Type is not required without a payload, so native GET omits it and sends Accept: application/vnd.api+json."
      ]
    },
    "users.list": {
      "upstreamActionId": "list_users",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "action-list-users",
        "handler-list-users",
        "request-auth"
      ],
      "documentationUrls": [
        "https://api.itglue.com/developer"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Returns raw IT Glue JSON:API under data instead of the source {users, meta, links, raw} wrapper.",
        "Optional pageNumber and pageSize bind to page[number] and page[size]; name, email, and roleName bind to filter[name], filter[email], and filter[role_name]. Include arrays are omitted because the native query template cannot comma-join them the way the pinned source does."
      ]
    },
